	(text "Regulation -- +VSYS to +3V3 (U8 buck) and +VBAT_LTE (U40 buck-boost)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 127 26.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
			)
		)
		(uuid "5926d5cf-017c-4cf8-a16a-c71477f01801")
	)
	(text "Regulation -- verified vs not (2026-11-17, power agent)\n\n+3V3 (U8 TPS62A02, TI SLUSEG9E): FB 453k/100k -> 3.318 V (Eq. 2, VFB 600 mV +/-1%). L1 = XFL4020-102MEC\n(footprint now assigned). C22 feedforward was wired VOUT-GND; moved across R8 and made DNP (value unverified at 3.3 V).\nEN is NOT tied to +VSYS: it is delayed 12-41 ms after U40 PG (R303/C303/R304) so nRF9151 VDD_GPIO (+3V3) rises\n>= 6 ms after VDD/ENABLE and falls first (nRF9151 HDG, VDD_GPIO). Assumes nRF9151 ENABLE is tied to +VBAT_LTE.\nPG -> TP405 only. On battery below ~3.45 V U8 runs at 100% duty and +3V3 tracks +VSYS (fine for all 3V3 loads).\n\n+VBAT_LTE (U40 TPS63802, TI SLVSEU9D): 3.59 V (562k/91k, Table 10-5). EN divider = 2.91 V off / 3.20 V on UVLO.\nU40 footprint is a PLACEHOLDER: the DLA0010A land pattern did not resolve cleanly from text. VERIFY BEFORE FAB.\n\nBreak points: R300 (+3V3) and R302 (+VBAT_LTE), 0R 0805 + DNP 2-pin header J30/J31 for a PPK2.\nFB always senses on the regulator side of the link. Test pads TP400-TP413."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f7d948ab-b1fd-43f1-8dff-e3c2861d729c")
	)
