				)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "U8 PG pull-up. TI SLUSEG9E Sec 7.4.2: PG is open-drain and needs a pull-up to a rail <= the recommended VIN; 100k sinks 33 uA when PG is low (IPG <= 1 mA, Table 6.3). Pulled to +3V3_REG (regulator side) so PG stays observable with R300 removed. PG gates nothing: every +3V3 load (DW3210 x4, BT840, nRF9151 VDD_GPIO, sensors, clock) is on this same rail, so there is no later rail to sequence. It is a bring-up observable on TP405 only."
			(at 248.92 85.09 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
