		(property "Description" "TPS62A02 feedback divider, top resistor (VOUT to FB). R1 = R2 x (VOUT/VFB - 1) = 100k x (3.3V/0.6V - 1) = 450k per datasheet Eq.2 -- 453k is the nearest standard E96 1% value (100k x 4.53), giving VOUT = 0.6V x (1 + 453k/100k) = 3.318V."
