		(property "Description" "EN_3V3 delay: pull-up from +VBAT_LTE_REG. With C303 = 1uF, tau = 100 ms. EN crosses U8's 1.2 V rising threshold (SLUSEG9E Table 6.5, max) at t = tau*ln(3.588/(3.588-1.2)) = 40.7 ms after U40 PG releases; even if the true threshold were as low as the 0.4 V falling threshold, t = 11.8 ms. Both exceed Nordic's 'VDD_GPIO should be applied at least 6 ms after ENABLE and VDD' (nRF9151 Hardware Design Guidelines, VDD_GPIO page). Also U40 PG's pull-up (via R304)."
			(at 195.58 140.97 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
