		(property "Description" "U40 VIN capacitor. TI SLVSEU9D Sec 10.2.2.4: 'A 10 uF input capacitor is recommended'; effective CI >= 4 uF (Sec 8.3). 0805 10 V X5R/X7R (not the 0603 6.3 V Table 10-4 part) because +VSYS reaches ~5 V on external power and a 6.3 V 0603 loses most of its capacitance at that bias. Place at VIN/GND pins."
