		(property "Description" "U40 output capacitor. SLVSEU9D Sec 10.2.2.3: 'a single 22 uF for all programmed output voltages <= 3.6 V'; effective CO >= 7 uF for VO > 2.3 V (Sec 8.3), no upper limit. 0805 10 V X5R. The nRF9151's own VDD bank (47 uF + 10 uF + 2x4.7 uF + 1 uF ..., nRF9151 HDG schematic Table 1) sits on +VBAT_LTE at the SiP on connectivity.kicad_sch."
