		(property "Description" "U40 FB top. SLVSEU9D Eq. 3 R1 = R2 x (VOUT/VFB - 1), VFB = 500 mV; Table 10-5 lists 562k/91k for 3.6 V. VOUT = 0.5 x (1 + 562/91) = 3.588 V nominal; VFB accuracy +/-1% (PWM, Sec 8.5) -> 3.55-3.62 V before resistor tolerance. Inside nRF9151 VDD 3.0-5.5 V (PS 'Recommended operating conditions', nominal 3.7 V) with 0.39 V margin over the 3.2 V LTE recommendation."
