		(property "Description" "Coilcraft XFL4020-102MEC, 1.0uH +/-20%, DCR 10.80/11.90 mOhm typ/max, Isat 4.5 A (10% drop) / 5.1 A (20%), Irms 5.4 A (20 C rise) -- Coilcraft Document 745-1 (XFL4020, revised 03/10/26). Replaces the TI-listed XGL3520-102MEC (SLUSEG9E Table 8-2) because KiCad ships a verified footprint for XFL4020 (L_Coilcraft_XxL4020) and none for XGL3520. Same 1.0uH value TI Table 8-3 marks '++' with Cout = 22uF for VOUT >= 1.8V; Isat 4.5 A exceeds the TPS62A02 high-side current limit IHS(OC) 3.4 A max (Table 6.5), so the inductor does not saturate before the IC limits."
			(at 133.35 87.63 90)
			(hide yes)
