		(property "Description" "Coilcraft XFL4020-471MEC, 0.47 uH +/-20%, DCR 4.40/5.10 mOhm typ/max, Isat 4.6 A (10% drop) / 6.6 A (20%), Irms 7.5 A (20 C rise) -- Coilcraft Document 745-1 (revised 03/10/26). TPS63802 needs L = 0.47 uH nominal (0.37-0.57 effective, SLVSEU9D Sec 8.3; Table 10-1). TI's own Table 10-2 part is XFL4015-471ME (5.4 A); XFL4020 chosen because KiCad ships its footprint (L_Coilcraft_XxL4020). Worst-case operating peak here is ~1 A (0.6 A out at 3.0 V in); the 4-5.75 A boost current limit only appears on a fault."
