		(property "Description" "TPS62A02PDDCR 2.5-5.5V-in 2A buck, SOT-23-6 (TI SLUSEG9E). +VSYS -> +3V3. EN (pin 1) driven by the EN_3V3 delay network (R303/C303/R304) so +3V3 comes up >= 6 ms after +VBAT_LTE (nRF9151 VDD_GPIO sequencing, nRF9151 HDG 'VDD_GPIO'). PG (pin 5) open-drain to TP405 with R301 100k pull-up to +3V3_REG; gates nothing. FB divider R8/R9 = 453k/100k -> 3.318 V (Eq. 2, VFB 600 mV typ). See regulation_notes.md."
			(at 110.49 90.17 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
