		(property "Description" "Current-measurement break point for +VBAT_LTE. 0R 0805 link (0805 rather than the 0603 house size: rated ~2 A for a jumper vs ~1 A for 0603, and nRF9151 TX subframes draw up to 505 mA). Remove it and insert a Power Profiler Kit II in ampere-meter mode across J31. The regulator's FB divider senses on the regulator side of this link, so removing it never opens the control loop."
			(at 195.58 200.66 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
