		(property "Description" "U40 EN divider top: board-level battery under-voltage cut-off (TI 'precise threshold enable'). EN thresholds 1.07/1.10/1.13 V rising, 0.97/1.00/1.03 V falling (SLVSEU9D Sec 8.5). Ratio (191k+100k)/100k = 2.91: off when +VSYS falls below 2.91 V (2.82-3.00 V), on above 3.20 V (3.11-3.29 V). Because U40 PG gates U8 EN, this also turns +3V3 off, so a flat cell browns the whole board out cleanly instead of LTE TX bursts dragging everything into reset loops. 12 uA divider load on +VSYS. Verify threshold against the chosen cell's discharge cut-off."
			(at 63.5 184.15 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
