		)
		(property "Description" "nRF9151 VDD supply (+VBAT_LTE). TI TPS63802DLAR buck-boost (SLVSEU9D). Chosen over feeding VDD straight from +VSYS because on battery +VSYS is the cell minus the Q1 and MCP73871 path drops, which falls below Nordic's 3.2 V LTE recommendation and towards its 3.0 V absolute floor ('Minimum voltage includes all voltage drops, ripple, and spikes', nRF9151 HDG Operating conditions) for the last part of the discharge, exactly while the modem draws up to 505 mA per TX subframe. Regulated 3.59 V output in boost or buck. 2 A output for VIN >= 2.3 V at 3.3 V out (Sec 8.5)."
			(at 101.6 200.66 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
