				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "Couples U40 (TPS63802) PG into EN_3V3. While PG is low, EN_3V3 = 3.588 V x 4.7k/104.7k = 0.16 V, below U8's 0.4 V falling threshold (SLUSEG9E Table 6.5). Limits the C303 discharge current through PG to 3.588 V/4.7k = 0.76 mA, inside the TPS63802 PG 1 mA sink rating (SLVSEU9D Sec 9.3.10). On power-down PG drops at 90% VOUT (or when U40 EN goes low, Table 9-1) and pulls +3V3 down before +VBAT_LTE, matching 'VDD_GPIO should be removed before removing ENABLE or VDD'. Remove R304 (and fit R305) to defeat sequencing."
			(at 220.98 140.97 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
